":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160088},{"name":"davidfig/fork-me-github","owner":"davidfig","html_url":"https://github.com/davidfig/fork-me-github","stars":0,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Programatically add fork me on github ribbon from javascript without making changes to CSS, HTML, or adding image files","topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160093},{"name":"karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","owner":"karmjeetnamol","html_url":"https://github.com/karmjeetnamol/react_portfolio","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This project was bootstrapped with Create React App.  Acceptance Criteria GIVEN a single-page application portfolio for a web developer WHEN I load the portfolio THEN I am presented with a page containing a header, a section for content, and a footer WHEN I view the header THEN I am presented with the developer's name and navigation with titles corresponding to different sections of the portfolio WHEN I view the navigation titles THEN I am presented with the titles About Me, Portfolio, Contact, and Resume, and the title corresponding to the current section is highlighted WHEN I click on a navigation title THEN I am presented with the corresponding section below the navigation without the page reloading and that title is highlighted WHEN I load the portfolio the first time THEN the About Me title and section are selected by default WHEN I am presented with the About Me section THEN I see a recent photo of the developer and a short bio about me WHEN I am presented with the Portfolio section THEN I see titled images of three of the developer\u2019s applications with links to both the deployed applications and the corresponding GitHub repository WHEN I am presented with the Contact section THEN I see a contact form with fields for a name, an email address, and a message WHEN I move my cursor out of one of the form fields without entering text THEN I receive a notification that this field is required WHEN I enter text into the email address field THEN I receive a notification if I have entered an invalid email address WHEN I view the footer THEN I am presented with text or icon links to the developer\u2019s GitHub and LinkedIn profiles.  In the project directory, you can run: npm start Runs the app in the development mode. Open http://localhost:3000 to view it in your browser.  The page will reload when you make changes. You may also see any lint errors in the console.","topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160101},{"name":"zbarovsky/comfy_frontend","owner":"zbarovsky","html_url":"https://github.com/zbarovsky/comfy_frontend","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160103},{"name":"lk9988/hw3_password_generator-","owner":"lk9988","html_url":"https://github.com/lk9988/hw3_password_generator-","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160106},{"name":"djjoo007/React_Employee_Directory","owner":"djjoo007","html_url":"https://github.com/djjoo007/React_Employee_Directory","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160110},{"name":"eblouin876/clicky-game","owner":"eblouin876","html_url":"https://github.com/eblouin876/clicky-game","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160111},{"name":"davidczerwinski/ecommerce","owner":"davidczerwinski","html_url":"https://github.com/davidczerwinski/ecommerce","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"The back-end for an online store","topics":[],"score":2269,"global_rank":160115},{"name":"nickibaldwin/bus-mall","owner":"nickibaldwin","html_url":"https://github.com/nickibaldwin/bus-mall","star